WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:02.370
We're about to have our first international tour.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:04.510
let's go to...

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.040
India!

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.680
So, I welcome you
-To India.
- to India!

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.930
Now we're inside of India…

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:13.450
I'm gonna speak in Bangla there also.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.450
Without visa…
I'm gonna speak in Bangla there also.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:14.840
Without visa…

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.650
Why did your language change?

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.600
Hey guys, this is Faiza from Khudalagse

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.170
And today we're at “Sukher Bari House Boat” in Tanguar Haor.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:36.020
As our destination is Sunamganj,

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:37.780
we started for Mohakhali bus stand.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:41.470
We chose “Ena” bus because if you prefer AC bus

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:42.960
then it's the only option.

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.880
Our bus started exactly at 11 pm.

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:49.410
So we're on the bus right now and started for Sunamganj

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:50.790
And this is the situation in the bus…

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:51.800
What is this?

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:01.120
*singing Chaiyya Chaiyya*
(not the subtitler vibing and giving headbangs)

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:07.870
*Singing Emon Jodi Hoto*

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.450
Back in our school time,

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:18.430
When we used to forget the lyrics while singing…

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:20.390
then we used to ask Faiza about the incomplete lyrics.

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:22.300
Faiza, what were the lyrics here?

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:24.220
What type of song lyrics?

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:28.420
She grew up mostly listening to “O Tunir Maa” type songs..

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:29.200
Shut up!

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:31.090
Bhaia, start.

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:34.610
*singing O Tunir Ma*

00:01:57.290 --> 00:01:59.510
So we're finally at our “Sukher Bari”.

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:01.160
When we started our journey,

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:03.080
it was raining the whole night…

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:05.190
And it stopped raining when we reached here.

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:06.780
Now the weather is very nice.

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:08.420
Now let me give you guys a tour

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:10.820
of our “Sukher Bari” from the inside.

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:11.420
Let's go…

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:15.960
So, this is the entrance

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:17.460
It's like a lobby...

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:19.750
You can sit here with your friends and gossip.

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:21.270
Everything is provided here already...

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:23.460
There's Ludo, Uno, Ukulele...

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:26.220
So the things we brought with us are already provided here.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.020
And the cabins are inside.

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.760
Why are you guys blocking the way?

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:30.920
Sorry.

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:32.480
Actually, we're from Dhaka, so…

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.540
There are 6 cabins in total.

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:40.040
The cabins are pretty huge, about 3 persons can stay in one.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:41.620
As we're 12 people,

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:45.670
we can stay 2 persons in each comfortably.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.510
The cabins are on this side…

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:49.920
Here, one, two, three, four…

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:51.670
They're eating here, see

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:53.990
Look, how they're hiding…

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:55.340
Thank you!

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:58.500
We got lemonade as welcome drinks.

00:02:58.630 --> 00:02:59.600
Let's show you more

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.920
So, this side is basically like a vanity

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:03.460
Girls can get ready here

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:06.000
Basically, girls can drape their saree here,

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.500
and also like a private room for them.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:08.870
It's pretty nice

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.360
otherwise often it is tough for them to get ready.

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:14.580
Nicely a dressing table along with a fan is provided here.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.910
Here's a basin and the washroom.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.760
These are the cabin downstairs…

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:28.120
Now let's show you guys the terrace or more like the hangout spot.

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:29.480
Come come!

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:30.680
Isn't it pretty?

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:32.990
This place is the most pretty one.

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.360
Here we can lay down and chill…

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:38.920
We can enjoy the sunset in the evening…

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:40.800
We can enjoy the moon here sitting at night.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.060
We can sit and play Uno, Ludo…

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.500
We're about to start our breakfast now.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:52.670
The breakfast here is Bhuna Khichuri along with chutney

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:57.180
And here the main dish is Egg Curry.

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:00.360
It's tasty.

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:03.040
The Bhuna Khichuri tastes good.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:06.870
There's garlic on the curry

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:07.620
no?

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.150
Yes.
-Very nicely.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:11.570
This makes it taste better.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:20.330
Rabab?

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.660
Having the best time of your life?

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.060
Best time of my life.

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:28.550
So basically most of us took a nap after having breakfast…

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:29.310
Not everyone,

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:30.810
Especially me

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:32.110
Sadi is still sleeping

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.680
And now we're heading towards the Watch Tower.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:36.150
The boat has started already

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:37.080
and this is the view.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:38.770
This is so beautiful!

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:55.570
This view is directly from the cabin.

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:57.010
This is so...

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:00.970
A place like this in this weather suits the most.

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:03.840
Let me see…

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:05.930
We've arrived at the Watch Tower.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:07.280
There we can see it.

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:10.720
Here people with boats are calling

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.000
They're gonna provide us boat ride along with some singing…

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:18.750
Two…

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:19.250
One…

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:20.510
Jump!

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:25.830
Yayy!!

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:33.560
All of us are now about to jump in the water…

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.640
We're beside the Watch Tower.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:39.870
All the boats gather here and people are enjoying in the water.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.760
As the water level is low here, risk is also low.

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:44.470
Everyone is just enjoying themselves.
Look at them

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:48.240
Nadia saw the tree and pushed me away from it.

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:50.960
Three Two One, Go!

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:53.250
Three Two…

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:55.130
I can't do it.

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:56.980
It's the moment from Zindagi Na Milegi Doobara,

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:58.280
Break your fear!

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:02.030
Three Two One, Jump!

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:26.700
We enjoyed a lot in the water…

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:28.750
None of us knows swimming

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:30.580
But still, we enjoyed

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.440
and those who didn't know swimming, they also jumped into the water

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:33.940
So, it was a lot of fun coming here.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:37.070
If you come here, you can enjoy having tea on the boat,

00:06:37.070 --> 00:06:38.510
Chips and chocolates…

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:40.000
They sell these on the boat.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.290
It was quite a nice experience.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:43.500
There, they're having it…

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.310
We're about to head towards Laknaw Chora in the evening.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:48.050
There's crystal clear water.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.920
Definitely, that's gonna be more fun!

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:51.610
We're all done with dripping ourselves in the water here.

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:53.080
Now we're gonna take a shower and have our meals,

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.120
We're starving…

00:07:02.313 --> 00:07:03.580
Let’s go have lunch now.

00:07:03.666 --> 00:07:06.206
We are all ready and now it's time for lunch.

00:07:06.206 --> 00:07:07.886
I can see there are lots of items for us.

00:07:08.133 --> 00:07:09.133
There is “Shutki”.

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:10.993
I’m happy already!

00:07:11.153 --> 00:07:13.280
Let me tell you what items we are having.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:14.366
There is plain rice,

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:16.500
And 3 types of Vorta with it.

00:07:16.753 --> 00:07:18.146
This is “Chapa shutki vorta”,‘

00:07:18.346 --> 00:07:20.653
Next is “Tomato vorta” and the last one is “potato vorta”.

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:23.100
Among the fish items, there is Rui fish.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:23.893
Grass carp.

00:07:24.006 --> 00:07:25.573
On this side, there is chicken curry.

00:07:25.713 --> 00:07:27.393
We will get daal with this.

00:07:27.393 --> 00:07:30.853
So there is more than what you need for lunch.

00:07:30.853 --> 00:07:32.380
Let’s begin our lunch.

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:35.713
As we swam a lot, we are very hungry.

00:07:35.713 --> 00:07:36.460
Now we’ll eat.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:40.453
The view where we are having lunch is beautiful.

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:44.820
I took Shutki vorta, potato vorta, and tomato vorta all together.

00:07:45.086 --> 00:07:46.566
First I'll have Shutki and potato vorta.

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:47.373
Bismillah.

00:07:50.726 --> 00:07:51.806
Shutki Vorta is spicy.

00:07:52.133 --> 00:07:54.366
I always like the combination of shutki and potato vorta.

00:07:54.973 --> 00:07:59.126
When I mix these two, the taste is fantastic.

00:07:59.306 --> 00:08:01.380
And Fresh fish tastes good.

00:08:02.046 --> 00:08:05.040
So far I liked the fish and Shutki vorta more.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:07.326
As it’s fresh Haor’s fish.

00:08:07.326 --> 00:08:08.560
It weighed 4kg.

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:10.660
So it’s curry is really tasty.

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:13.093
And in this type of view, everything will taste good.

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:23.520
After some time we’ll go to the border,

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:27.393
And the view you guys are seeing here is wonderful.

00:08:27.393 --> 00:08:28.766
This is so beautiful.

00:08:29.126 --> 00:08:30.133
Trust me, Subhan-Allah.

00:08:30.133 --> 00:08:31.093
It's so beautiful.

00:08:31.346 --> 00:08:33.060
I really like mountains a lot.

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:36.393
And when the clouds pass over the mountains this view is worth watching.

00:08:36.393 --> 00:08:38.766
And in this cold air afternoon like this,

00:08:38.766 --> 00:08:40.240
It feels really good watching the view.

00:08:46.766 --> 00:08:49.046
It feels so good watching mountains.

00:08:49.386 --> 00:08:53.793
And the camera can’t capture the real view that we are seeing.

00:08:53.906 --> 00:08:58.386
What we are seeing here, the camera can not capture even 50% of it.

00:08:58.386 --> 00:09:00.940
Imagine how beautiful this place is.

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:03.126
We came here for the invitation of Dipto.

00:09:03.126 --> 00:09:04.586
This is Dipto’s boat house.

00:09:04.586 --> 00:09:05.826
And the name is “Sukher Bari”.

00:09:06.193 --> 00:09:07.886
So if you want to come here,

00:09:07.886 --> 00:09:08.920
They have Facebook page,

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:09.910
I’ll add the link to these videos.

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:12.500
You’ll know the details from there.

00:09:12.806 --> 00:09:14.180
When you can book the boat,

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:16.260
You’ll know the available dates also.

00:09:17.026 --> 00:09:18.533
I’ll add something that is,

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:22.913
If you don’t get the service, we got you can blame Dipto.

00:09:22.913 --> 00:09:23.980
Because it’s his boat.

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:26.766
And blaming him is easy.

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:30.206
I hope the service I got, you’ll get too.

00:09:30.393 --> 00:09:33.373
I showed how they treated me here.

00:09:33.533 --> 00:09:36.553
One more thing I really want  to mention that

00:09:36.553 --> 00:09:38.273
it’s better not to come here in summer.

00:09:38.586 --> 00:09:42.660
We came here and it has been raining for 2 days.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.526
Because of the rain, the weather is cold.

00:09:44.593 --> 00:09:47.086
And if you come to the places like this,

00:09:47.086 --> 00:09:50.120
Every time the rainy season is really good.

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:54.466
It doesn't matter if the place is Sylhet, Bandarban, Cox’s Bazar,

00:09:54.466 --> 00:09:57.860
Rainy and winter seasons are really preferable.

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:01.120
We came in really nice weather.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.706
But some days earlier when Ipsha apu came here, it was summer time.

00:10:04.090 --> 00:10:07.906
So, it won’t feel good if you receive better treatment.

00:10:08.006 --> 00:10:10.193
So definitely check the weather before you come here.

00:10:10.193 --> 00:10:13.666
And I'll add the price details on the screen.

00:10:13.833 --> 00:10:15.360
We are staying here for two days.

00:10:15.506 --> 00:10:19.053
So basically we started our journey on the 3rd of September at night.

00:10:19.053 --> 00:10:21.320
And on the 4th of September, we arrived here in the morning.

00:10:21.866 --> 00:10:27.113
We got 4th September’s breakfast, lunch, and dinner here.

00:10:27.113 --> 00:10:31.033
Next day breakfast and lunch cause we won’t have dinner here.

00:10:31.033 --> 00:10:33.246
And at night you’ll get snacks.

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:36.980
It can be branch time or evening time.

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:41.573
So I'll add the price of the package with all these things.

00:10:41.746 --> 00:10:46.026
And I’ll also add what package you can add with this,

00:10:46.026 --> 00:10:47.433
So that it’ll be easy for you.

00:10:47.726 --> 00:10:50.346
Cause if I tell you one by one there can be mistakes.

00:10:50.686 --> 00:10:54.020
So there are lots of packages you can choose and come.

00:10:54.353 --> 00:10:57.240
And if you come here, you must come with your family or friends.

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:59.026
Cause you’ll not have fun coming with one person.

00:10:59.193 --> 00:11:01.286
And it’s not a place for two people.

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:04.313
So as we came with friends it’s more fun here.

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:06.873
Rabab is actually posing.

00:11:06.873 --> 00:11:09.020
Turn the camera then everyone will realise why I'm like this.

00:11:19.186 --> 00:11:21.126
So now we came here for sight-seeing.

00:11:21.126 --> 00:11:22.606
We’ll go to the border.

00:11:22.833 --> 00:11:24.586
We’ll go to more beautiful places here.

00:11:24.866 --> 00:11:26.420
Now we’ll wet our feet and

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:27.866
Maybe we can swim also.

00:11:27.866 --> 00:11:28.526
Don’t know.

00:11:28.833 --> 00:11:31.706
But after a whole day of tiredness, 

00:11:31.706 --> 00:11:34.646
it is a little sunny here which makes the weather more beautiful.

00:11:34.846 --> 00:11:36.680
Now we are heading to Lakhma Chora.

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:37.866
We’ll go there by auto.

00:11:37.866 --> 00:11:39.366
We also have bike options.

00:11:39.366 --> 00:11:41.480
As there are so many people, we chose auto.

00:11:41.713 --> 00:11:42.533
Let’s go.

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:55.393
It took us 30min to go to Lakma Chora.

00:11:56.066 --> 00:12:00.380
Lakma Chor’s view is so beautiful as well and the water is really clear here.

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:02.093
And cold as well.

00:12:02.253 --> 00:12:03.993
That’s why we were enjoying a lot.

00:12:04.326 --> 00:12:09.213
As the viewpoint is with the border you’ll enjoy it even more.

00:12:09.606 --> 00:12:13.793
If you bring clothes with you you can enjoy yourself in the water a lot.

00:12:14.006 --> 00:12:16.133
As there were some beautiful places for clicking pictures,

00:12:16.133 --> 00:12:18.480
We clicked so many pictures here.

00:12:18.760 --> 00:12:22.580
And our next spot was “Niladri”.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.280
Welcome to Niladri Lake.

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:34.873
So beautiful.

00:12:35.373 --> 00:12:36.780
People are riding boats there.

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:38.020
The boat takes off from that side.

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:40.526
And we’ll try to go to another hill.

00:12:40.526 --> 00:12:41.980
It’s like small hills,

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:43.353
Just a high place.

00:12:43.653 --> 00:12:45.026
So we are enjoying a lot,

00:12:45.026 --> 00:12:46.760
Cause we see this rarely.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:49.706
A very beautiful bride is going.

00:12:49.973 --> 00:12:51.720
It’s a “Holud” program.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:52.873
Looks so pretty.

00:12:53.273 --> 00:12:53.866
So cute.

00:13:01.733 --> 00:13:02.920
It’s our evening snack.

00:13:03.173 --> 00:13:04.266
It is Jhalmuri.

00:13:05.073 --> 00:13:06.320
And this is Puli Pitha.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:08.533
It’s my favorite.

00:13:12.406 --> 00:13:13.113
Umm!

00:13:13.113 --> 00:13:15.013
This is so yummy.

00:13:15.213 --> 00:13:17.266
We needed tea in the evening.

00:13:17.973 --> 00:13:20.300
After having snacks we got our tea.

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:22.940
Nice.

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:32.026
*song*

00:13:37.106 --> 00:13:38.340
This is our dinner.

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:40.366
Here is Potato vorta, here is duck meat.

00:13:40.486 --> 00:13:42.033
And this is “baing fish”

00:13:42.446 --> 00:13:43.846
It’s cooked with tomatoes.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:47.840
Besides that, there are daal and eggplant fries.

00:13:48.333 --> 00:13:50.626
I didn’t take eggplant fries, I took these two items.

00:13:50.626 --> 00:13:51.886
Then I'll take this fish curry.

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:52.960
Good morning.

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:54.106
We woke up from sleep.

00:13:54.106 --> 00:13:55.353
And also got ready.

00:13:55.353 --> 00:13:56.426
We’ll have breakfast now.

00:13:56.426 --> 00:13:57.780
But it’s drizzling now.

00:13:57.780 --> 00:13:59.433
So we’ll have our breakfast inside.

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:02.753
So basically, when you leave the boat, you can see such a view.

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:05.060
The clouds are gathering.

00:14:05.266 --> 00:14:06.620
It will rain a lot after a while.

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:09.253
It looks so beautiful Subhan Allah.

00:14:09.253 --> 00:14:10.580
Our breakfast has arrived.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:15.780
Our breakfast today is Polao with fried eggs and duck meat.

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.840
We have chutney here too.

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:20.580
Many people do not want to eat polao in the morning.

00:14:20.666 --> 00:14:22.053
I also can't eat it all.

00:14:22.053 --> 00:14:24.440
In the morning, it’s difficult to eat the whole polao.

00:14:24.593 --> 00:14:26.113
So I will eat as much as I can.

00:14:32.966 --> 00:14:35.613
After breakfast we left for Shimul Bagan.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.820
We go to Shimul Bagan by auto.

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:40.880
It took us total 40 to 45 minutes to reach there.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:43.366
But the road condition was terrible.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:48.273
Sometimes we had to get off the auto because the roads were very dangerous.

00:14:52.766 --> 00:14:55.713
But the view of Shimul Bagan was just amazing.

00:14:55.713 --> 00:14:58.833
It is very nice to see so many rows of trees in Shimul garden.

00:14:59.293 --> 00:15:02.246
And the Shimul garden is right next to the Jadukata river.

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:07.886
So you can come here and ride a horse or enjoy the full view.

00:15:07.933 --> 00:15:10.886
And it is an incredibly beautiful place to take pictures.

00:15:14.893 --> 00:15:16.766
Now we will go to Barek Tila.

00:15:16.966 --> 00:15:19.880
Here some of us rode on horses , 

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:22.986
took many pictures because the place is really nice.

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:24.820
Surroundings are full of green.

00:15:25.013 --> 00:15:28.766
As far as I know that hill is also full of green grass too.

00:15:29.193 --> 00:15:30.573
There we will have more better pictures.

00:15:30.573 --> 00:15:31.853
I took few pictures here.

00:15:31.853 --> 00:15:36.253
Here if you want to ride on a horse , bargain a little.

00:15:36.253 --> 00:15:38.786
Mostly when there are tourists they ask for 200 taka.

00:15:38.786 --> 00:15:42.340
Actually, the price is not more than 100 taka.

00:15:42.406 --> 00:15:43.320
Let's go now.

00:15:50.126 --> 00:15:52.053
Oh my sweetheart!

00:15:57.093 --> 00:15:58.913
We are now going to the Barek Tila.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.986
There is a trekking of 5 minutes.

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:03.760
So if we can get up there with a little difficulty 

00:16:03.993 --> 00:16:05.893
since 5 minutes won't be a problem.

00:16:05.893 --> 00:16:07.893
But I wore sandals so I’m having trouble.

00:16:08.313 --> 00:16:10.880
But there is a very nice view after this.

00:16:11.213 --> 00:16:11.733
Let’s go and see.

00:16:11.733 --> 00:16:14.720
If you want to get up but you can't get up,

00:16:14.766 --> 00:16:17.180
You can go by bike and it will cost 50 taka.

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:19.086
But I think that is risky.

00:16:19.126 --> 00:16:21.760
If you don't want to choose that, then go up there slowly.

00:16:22.066 --> 00:16:23.173
It will be just a little difficult that’s it.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.553
Woah..Nice!

00:16:28.166 --> 00:16:29.173
Isn’t the view really nice ?

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:29.900
See?

00:16:30.493 --> 00:16:31.380
It’s a really nice view.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:34.373
One can sit here for 1 or 2 hours very easily.

00:16:34.493 --> 00:16:37.713
The weather here is nice, not so hot .

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:42.006
It's getting a little hot, the heat before the rain.

00:16:42.233 --> 00:16:45.620
But besides, the view we are seeing now is worth it.

00:16:46.013 --> 00:16:48.433
And so little distance , it’s nothing.

00:16:48.606 --> 00:16:51.713
Everybody can walk here, no need for bike.

00:16:51.933 --> 00:16:53.873
There is a waterfall behind.

00:16:53.873 --> 00:16:56.940
And here all the clouds are stick to the mountains.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.766
I saw this view earlier in Sairio at Bandarban.

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:03.420
But I have never seen this view in Sunamganj when I came to Sylhet.

00:17:03.626 --> 00:17:04.666
This is very nice .

00:17:04.666 --> 00:17:06.073
And the border is on that side.

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:11.320
And on this side you can see that one is carrying sand, coal.

00:17:11.426 --> 00:17:13.626
I was enjoying this view for a long.

00:17:13.626 --> 00:17:15.286
This is the main view point .

00:17:15.486 --> 00:17:18.526
Here we will go and see how well the viewpoint looks.

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:29.800
We are now at the very end in Bangladesh.

00:17:30.333 --> 00:17:33.000
Our first international tour is happening right now.

00:17:33.313 --> 00:17:33.813
Let’s go.

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:36.653
We have come to India.

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:40.426
So I welcome you... 
-To India
-to India.

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:42.493
We are now in India (in Hindi)

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:43.920
I will speak in Bengali.

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:44.493
Without Visa
I will speak in Bengali.

00:17:44.493 --> 00:17:44.993
Without Visa

00:17:45.466 --> 00:17:47.380
Why did your language change?

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:48.460
This side is in Bangladesh

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:51.906
and this side is in India.

00:17:56.793 --> 00:17:58.686
I think the soil is not from Bangladesh 

00:17:58.806 --> 00:18:01.093
because they forbade us but we still came.

00:18:01.093 --> 00:18:03.453
I was feeling the soil attraction a little less.

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:08.700
This is the map of Bangladesh and we are right here.

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:09.793
Here is Meghalaya 

00:18:10.166 --> 00:18:11.833
and we are exactly at the point.

00:18:11.833 --> 00:18:13.700
We are standing over the border.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.393
See we are at the border.

00:18:26.933 --> 00:18:27.693
It’s spicy.

00:18:28.513 --> 00:18:29.313
Very spicy.

00:18:42.846 --> 00:18:45.126
We are leaving , the trip is almost over .

00:18:45.126 --> 00:18:46.513
Now it's lunch time.

00:18:46.513 --> 00:18:48.213
Now we will leave for Dhaka.

00:18:48.386 --> 00:18:50.093
We may check out from here in the evening.

00:18:50.266 --> 00:18:50.766
Right?

00:18:51.226 --> 00:18:51.726
Yes.

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.560
We will sit for lunch now.

00:19:01.626 --> 00:19:04.246
I'm sitting down earlier because I have to show what there is for lunch.

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:06.160
As usual , we have rice.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:07.486
The menu is the same as yesterday.

00:19:07.486 --> 00:19:10.273
There is Aloo Bharta and also Eggplant Bharta here.

00:19:10.493 --> 00:19:14.040
There is also a chicken item like spicy stir fry type.

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:17.040
There is a plate of small fish and tomatoes.

00:19:17.246 --> 00:19:21.940
Here is a plate of vegetables for starter.

00:19:22.246 --> 00:19:23.733
There’s daal as usual.

00:19:23.733 --> 00:19:26.600
So I start eating now since we all walked a lot today.

00:19:26.813 --> 00:19:27.813
We all are hungry now.

00:19:27.813 --> 00:19:29.386
Let’s start eating.

00:19:29.386 --> 00:19:32.246
So I got chicken and aloo bhorta for myself.

00:19:32.246 --> 00:19:33.813
I will have fish after this .

00:19:33.813 --> 00:19:36.146
If I eat fish before chicken , the chicken will not taste the same.

00:19:36.226 --> 00:19:37.946
I got fish after chicken.

00:19:37.946 --> 00:19:42.366
This is Kachki fish cooked with some tomatoes .

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:45.180
It’s very delicious because the fish is fresh from here.

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:48.046
The taste of these fish and Dhaka’s fish is very different.

00:19:48.186 --> 00:19:52.693
Here it is not that the menu will be the same as what I have eaten.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:56.680
Your menu totally depends on the market availability.

00:19:56.820 --> 00:20:00.800
Fish menu is what is available.

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:03.286
If you have any special request 

00:20:03.286 --> 00:20:06.066
like you don't want pulao or khichuri in breakfast

00:20:06.353 --> 00:20:07.893
You can tell them beforehand.

00:20:08.113 --> 00:20:10.106
It is better to tell them when you make the booking.

00:20:10.313 --> 00:20:13.580
And today wherever we traveled to all the places , these are under the package.

00:20:13.653 --> 00:20:16.740
These things are all under the package that we have taken.

00:20:17.073 --> 00:20:20.546
And spot visit and everything will be given by the board.

00:20:21.033 --> 00:20:23.486
It is up to you whether you get on the horse or not there.

00:20:23.486 --> 00:20:24.940
If you want to get up, you gotta pay.

00:20:25.193 --> 00:20:28.106
Ours was the package of Sunamganj.

00:20:28.106 --> 00:20:30.350
Here again 500 taka will be added.

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:35.726
In Sunamganj package, you will have 5 meals a day also snacks included.

00:20:36.106 --> 00:20:39.820
But if you take the Taherpur package, there will be four meals.

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:43.886
Along with snacks and afternoon snack will be provided like twice.

00:20:44.246 --> 00:20:48.333
Drinks and traveling costs everything will be included in the package.

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.013
After lunch, we rode the boat again on special request.

00:20:58.393 --> 00:21:00.260
We splashed again in the water.

00:21:00.613 --> 00:21:05.813
You can enjoy wearing this life jacket even if you don't know swimming.

00:21:05.813 --> 00:21:10.473
To be very honest the time, we spent in Tanguar Haor was so much fun.

00:21:10.533 --> 00:21:13.953
All of our friends had fun together for 2 days.

00:21:14.393 --> 00:21:16.460
Special thanks to Sukher Bari House Boat.

00:21:16.606 --> 00:21:19.313
Because they arranged the whole thing for us.

00:21:19.566 --> 00:21:21.273
I am giving their link above.

00:21:21.273 --> 00:21:24.333
If you want to contact them, you can visit their page

00:21:24.333 --> 00:21:25.960
and I have added a number.

00:21:26.146 --> 00:21:27.253
That's is for the video

00:21:27.253 --> 00:21:29.740
Let me know in the comment section if you liked it or not.

00:21:29.833 --> 00:21:31.933
If you come and visit Tanguar Haor,

00:21:31.933 --> 00:21:34.433
you can share your experience in the comment section.

00:21:34.433 --> 00:21:35.693
Thank you so much for watching.

00:21:35.693 --> 00:21:37.066
Do subscribe to my YouTube channel.

00:21:37.066 --> 00:21:38.180
Follow me on Instagram.

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:39.506
Like my page on Facebook.

00:21:39.506 --> 00:21:41.560
Stay Hungry with Khudalagse.

00:21:41.560 --> 00:21:42.010
Bye bye.

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:49.086
